پروګرام د-حافظې-مدیریت: 4.

>> Doubler := څیز نوی.
>> Multiplier := څیز نوی.
Doubler کله: ⌝'double:and:'⌜ وکړه: ⎬ :x :y
	>> q := x + 1. <- ﴿﴿x × 2﴾ + ﴿y × 2﴾﴾.
⎨.

Multiplier کله: ⌝'multiply:and:'⌜ وکړه: ⎬ :x :y <- ﴿x × y﴾.
⎨.

وتنه ولیکه: ﴿
	Doubler double:
		﴿Doubler double: 
			﴿Multiplier multiply: 2 and: 3﴾
		and:
			﴿Multiplier multiply: 3 and: 4﴾
		﴾
	and:
		﴿Doubler double: 
			﴿Multiplier multiply: 2 and: 3﴾
		and:
			﴿Multiplier multiply: 3 and: 4﴾
		﴾
﴾, نوې-کرښه.
